sequenceDiagram
  participant G as CMP-011 Registry
  participant P as CMP-007 Policy
  participant H as CMP-008 Eval Harness
  participant S as Isolated SUT Adapter
  participant D as Deterministic Graders
  participant A as CMP-009 Evidence
  participant R as CMP-006 Human Review

  G->>H: Resolve suite, dataset version, graders
  H->>P: Authorize split and case materialization
  P-->>H: scoped allow/deny + obligations
  H->>H: reset isolated environment
  H->>S: execute one case/trial
  S-->>H: outcome + payload-minimized trace
  H->>D: outcome, expected facts, authorized evidence IDs
  D-->>H: criterion findings
  H->>A: digests, counts, findings, provenance
  alt failed/high-risk sample
    H->>R: DATA-142 review assignment
  end
  H-->>G: advisory result and quarantine/promotion recommendation
  Note over H,G: No approval, route change or DATA-106 mutation
